00:11:18.105 --> 00:11:25.785
Tarps and plywood will be placed immediately in front of the wall in the lake bed and approved by the wetlands agent prior to the commencement of any activity.

00:11:26.265 --> 00:11:32.025
At the end of each workday, any loose sediment or material shall be placed on tarp and or plywood and securely covered.

00:11:32.670 --> 00:11:34.270
Staked

00:11:34.270 --> 00:11:38.910
hay bales will be placed on the lakeside of the work area to prevent debris from entering the water.

00:11:39.390 --> 00:11:47.870
Staked hay bales will be placed in any tracks or ruts that may develop. And at the conclusion of construction, these areas will be seeded and covered with straw mat to ensure revegetation.

00:11:48.565 --> 00:11:50.725
